    "detailed_description": "This is an RPG where you can decide what kind of build you are going to make. Become a tank that focuses on damage mitigation, healing and reflecting damage back to your opponents or a glass cannon that focuses on high burst damage with massive lifesteal or a summoner focused on buffing up their summon and ranged damage.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Progress through the game with your friends.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Select a class and level up your character.<br></li><li> Loot enchanted weapons and upgrade your armor.<br></li><li> Farming!<br></li><li> Clear dungeons for loot.<br></li><li> Enchant your armor for specific builds with a lot of freedom (lifesteal, reflect, hp regen...)<br></li><li> Micromanage the look on your character with 13 different armorpieces (left lower bracer, left upper bracer, left glove..)<br><br>You can only play this with people on your Steam friends list. Invite or join them through the Steam overlay.<br><br><strong>This game is 100% free.</strong></li></ul>",
